{
  "id": "dedication",
  "kind": "dedication",
  "sourceKind": "dedication",
  "label": "Dedication",
  "title": "DEDICATION",
  "shortTitle": "DEDICATION",
  "sourceRange": [
    51,
    69
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "title": 51
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is dedicated to every mind that has ever tried to find certainty in an uncertain experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 52
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To those who have spent years trying to become “enough” without knowing when that idea began."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 53
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To those who have mistaken thought for truth, and search for necessity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 54
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To the ones who believed something was missing…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 55
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and built entire lives around that belief."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 56
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And to those who may one day notice…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 57
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that the feeling of incompleteness was never evidence of incompleteness."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 58
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Only a pattern of thought repeating itself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 59
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "May this work not comfort you."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "May it not reassure you."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 61
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "May it not offer escape."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 62
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And if it changes anything at all…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 63
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "it may only be this:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the seriousness with which certain thoughts are taken."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 65
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because when that seriousness loosens…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 66
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "even slightly…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 67
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "what remains is not a new answer."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 68
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But the possibility that no answer was ever required."
        },
        {
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 69
    }
  ],
  "index": 4,
  "file": "chapters/04-dedication.json"
}
